  "details": "It is pretty common in node graph editors to quickly prototype with constants (as they're faster to add) and then convert them into exposed or just shared variables after the logic is complete.\nCurrently its a pretty long process that makes you go through the whole variable creation flow.\nIt would be great if we could one click convert a constant into a variable via a special button in the ui or a right click menu that would maybe even show some dialogue to add a name and mark public right there would be very helpful.\nBut even just making it a private var with autoGenerated name is already great UX improvement",
